<title>THAILAND: Oriental pays 7.0 baht div 2nd half 1996.</title>
<headline>Oriental pays 7.0 baht div 2nd half 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for second half ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   SECOND HALF</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  7.00	   vs	6.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 May 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment Date	May 23, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is The Oriental Hotel Plc. It is a major hotel chain.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
